  "paper_id": "sigcomm-2025-raha-a-general-tool-to-analyze-wan-degradation-d3ad8448",
  "title": "Raha: A General Tool to Analyze WAN Degradation",
  "abstract": "Raha is the first general tool that can analyze probable degradation of traffic engineered networks under arbitrary failures and traffic shifts to prevent outages. Raha addresses a significant gap in prior work which consider only (1) ≤ k failures; (2) specific traffic engineering schemes; and (3) the maximum impact of failures irrespective of the network design point.",
